# A single track branch with two level crossings on it, used to test the
# crossing columns without dragging the whole of Kingsmoor into it.

scheme marlow {
    area "Marlow Road"
    prefix M
}

node W boundary
node E boundary
node J1 plain
node J2 plain

edge B1 from W to J1 length 700 speed 50 direction down
edge B2 from J1 to J2 length 900 speed 50 direction down
edge B3 from J2 to E length 400 speed 50 direction down

section MA over B1
section MB over B2
section MC over B3

signal M1 on B1 at 700 facing forward direction down aspects 3
signal M3 on B2 at 900 facing forward direction down aspects 3

crossing LC21 on B2 at 300 type mcb strike_in 30
crossing LC23 on B2 at 700 type ahb
crossing LC25 on B3 at 200 type uwc
